synopsis: "Library to streamline writing new ppx derivers."
description: """

Provides a framework that does most of the boilerplate work of writing a new ppx deriver.
A ppx writer can define a series of callbacks to handle a given shape of type rather than
writing the full core type and type declaration recursion.
"""
